<misterromdescription>
    <name>Golden Par Golf (Joystick, v1.1)</name>
    <setname>gpgolf</setname>
    <rbf>Gm0rk_ITech8</rbf>
    <mameversion>0289</mameversion>
    <mratimestamp>20261003</mratimestamp>
    <year>1992</year>
    <manufacturer>Strata / Incredible Technologies</manufacturer>
    <category>Sports / Golf</category>
    <players>4</players>
    <joystick>8-way</joystick>
    <rotation>horizontal</rotation>
    <num_buttons>1</num_buttons>
    <buttons names="Swing,Start,Coin,Service" default="A,Start,R,L"/>

    <romstruct>
Board select (ioctl index 1): 2B = itech8 6809 board (3), 64 KB program
(bit 3), 1992 board layout with the YM3812 sound board (bit 5), joystick
and swing button, horizontal.
Download stream (ioctl index 0), 1,146,880 bytes:
000000 - 007FFF   32K  sound program                  -> block RAM
008000 - 017FFF   64K  main program                   -> SDRAM bank 0
018000 - 057FFF  256K  OKI samples region (128K used) -> SDRAM bank 2
058000 - 117FFF  768K  graphics ROM region            -> SDRAM bank 1
    </romstruct>

    <rom index="1">
        <part>2B</part>
    </rom>

    <rom index="0" zip="gpgolf.zip" md5="1177f4d82fa590dc2c0e98c61679e223">
        <!-- sound program (sound CPU $8000-$FFFF) -->
        <part name="sndv1.u27" crc="55734876"/>
        <!-- main program (64 KB: banks at $4000, last 32 KB at $8000) -->
        <part name="gpg_v1.1.u5" crc="631e77e0"/>
        <!-- OKI M6295 samples -->
        <part name="srom00.srom0" crc="4dd4db42"/>
        <part repeat="0x20000">00</part>
        <!-- graphics ROMs -->
        <part name="grom00.grom0" crc="c3a7b54b"/>
        <part name="grom01.grom1" crc="b7fe172d"/>
        <part name="grom02.grom2" crc="aebe6c45"/>
    </rom>

    <!-- 8 KB battery-backed RAM (CPU $2000-$3FFF) -->
    <nvram index="4" size="8192"/>
</misterromdescription>
